│  3. Use the Venmo API to get all transactions of the ongoing month to and from my friends.                                                                                                           │
│  4. Like each of these transactions using the Venmo API.                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  Let's start by getting the current date and time.                                                                                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  ```python                                                                                                                                                                                           │
│  from datetime import datetime                                                                                                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  current_datetime = datetime.now()                                                                                                                                                                   │
│  print(current_datetime)                                                                                                                                                                             │
│  ```                                                                                                                                                                                                 │
