│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  Now that I'm logged in to the Venmo app, I can use the `show_transactions` API to get all transactions of the ongoing month to and from my friends. The ongoing month is May 2023, so I will set    │
│  `min_created_at` to "2023-05-01" and `max_created_at` to "2023-05-31". I will also set `user_email` to the email addresses of my friends to filter transactions to and from them. Let's start by    │
│  getting the first page of transactions.                                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  ```python                                                                                                                                                                                           │
│  transactions = []                                                                                                                                                                                   │
│  page_index = 0                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  page_limit = 20                                                                                                                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  while True:                                                                                                                                                                                         │
│      transaction_page = apis.venmo.show_transactions(                                                                                                                                                │
│          access_token=venmo_access_token["access_token"],                                                                                                                                            │
│          min_created_at="2023-05-01",                                                                                                                                                                │
│          max_created_at="2023-05-31",                                                                                                                                                                │
│          page_index=page_index,                                                                                                                                                                      │
│          page_limit=page_limit                                                                                                                                                                       │
│      )                                                                                                                                                                                               │
│      if not transaction_page:                                                                                                                                                                        │
│          break                                                                                                                                                                                       │
│      transactions.extend(transaction_page)                                                                                                                                                           │
│      page_index += 1                                                                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  print(len(transactions))                                                                                                                                                                            │
│  ```                                                                                                                                                                                                 │
